/*
 * Defines result containers used during match-pattern validation.
 *
 * MatchResult accumulates the global state of validating all match lines:
 * 
 *   - test expressions for each branch
 *   - resulting values for each branch
 *   - errors encountered during validation
 *   - the resulting type of the match expression
 *   - whether the match is complete
 *   - memory information propagated across branches
 *
 * MatchLineResult stores the outcome of validating a single match line:
 *   - variables introduced by the pattern
 *   - the test expression for the line (pattern + guard)
 *   - memory information
 *   - the resulting value and type of the branch
 *
 * These records are used by MatchValidation to build the final match
 * expression as nested conditionals and to enforce completeness rules.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::control::match_::result::match_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/control/match_/result/match_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-07
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
